# fixture identity: compact-vehicle
# fixture element: boxy body with armored side panels and raised rear deck
# fixture element: four wheels with blocky tire rims and hub caps
# fixture element: cab canopy plus short sensor mast above the chassis
# fixture element: front/back distinction from blue cab windshield, front lights, and rear cargo crate
# fixture element: asymmetrical antenna and left-side tool arm mounted off center
# fixture asymmetry: left-side tool arm and single right-rear antenna break mirror symmetry
# fixture stressor-silhouette: rounded-implied wheel forms must read from blocky tire clusters under the body
# fixture stressor-silhouette: strong directionality from cab, headlights, rear cargo, and sensor mast
# fixture stressor-material: repeated details across four wheels, hub caps, headlights, cargo bands, and side plates
# fixture stressor-view: body/wheel occlusion must stay deterministic where the chassis overlaps the wheel tops
# fixture stressor-view: multi-view consistency for antenna, tool arm, cab, and four-wheel spacing
model compact-vehicle
size 18 11 14
palette phase0Props
color roverBody #56636b
color darkRubber #202326
color hubSteel #8e928c
color cabGlass #6eb3c7
color signalOrange #d87a32
color cargoGreen #4f7654
material body roverBody
material tire darkRubber
material hub hubSteel
material glass cabGlass
material accent signalOrange
material cargo cargoGreen

# boxy chassis and armored body
fill body 3..14 3..6 3..10
fill body 5..12 6..7 4..9
fill body 2..15 4..5 5..8

# cab, sensor mast, and rear cargo distinguish front from back
fill glass 5..8 7..9 3..5
fill body 5..8 6..7 3..3
fill hub 9..9 8..10 6..6
voxel accent 9 10 6
fill cargo 11..14 7..8 6..10
fill hub 11..14 8..8 8..8

# four blocky rounded-implied wheel clusters with hubs
fill tire 1..4 0..3 2..4
fill tire 1..4 0..3 9..11
fill tire 13..16 0..3 2..4
fill tire 13..16 0..3 9..11
fill hub 2..3 1..2 1..1
fill hub 2..3 1..2 12..12
fill hub 14..15 1..2 1..1
fill hub 14..15 1..2 12..12

# front lights, rear plate, and repeated side details
voxel accent 4 4 2
voxel accent 7 4 2
voxel hub 10 4 2
voxel hub 12 4 2
fill accent 14..15 4..5 11..11
fill hub 3..14 3..3 4..4
fill hub 3..14 3..3 9..9

# asymmetrical tool arm and antenna
fill hub 0..2 5..5 7..7
fill hub 0..0 4..5 7..7
voxel accent 0 3 7
fill hub 15..15 6..10 10..10
voxel accent 15 10 10
